      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine oats, whole wheat flour, brown sugar, cinnamon, baking powder, and baking soda in a large bowl; stir in peanut butter, margarine, and egg. Add zucchini; mix thoroughly.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
